#X msg 130 975 @length;
#X text 270 975 Event length. A plain number or a number with the 'ms'
suffix fixes the event length for any event duration. A value with
the '%' suffix is treated as a percentage of the event duration (expected
in the 0\..100 range). A negative value is subtracted from the event
duration (duration + @length) \, but the result is never less than
1\. Type: float. Default value: 75\.;
